    "native": "Actual SQLite driver wrapped through the existing deadlineBoundary seam; production sqliteConnector retained. Eight separate uncooperative boundaries: native Open, initialization PRAGMA, zero-wait initialization, operation setup PRAGMA, Rows.Next, precommit UPDATE, matched COMMIT response and native Close. Separate unchanged-assertion native QueryContext regression. Original 500ms context/1.5s caller guard. All barriers release finitely.",
